			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"葉卡捷琳娜"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 10100201,
					"content": "#歡迎，「公子」大人的朋友，{NICKNAME}。祝{F#妳}{M#你}今後在「愚人眾」平步青雲。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100202,
						10100203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉卡捷琳娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100202,
					"content": "我不是「公子」的朋友。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100204,
					"content": "呵…我們都是凡人，不是「冰之女皇」。凡人的想法就像冰層下的水…是不會永遠堅固銳利的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉卡捷琳娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100205,
					"content": "#失禮了，請容我回到正題。「公子」大人說，他與{F#妳}{M#你}們的約定已經完成了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉卡捷琳娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100206,
					"content": "約定完成了？啊，是指他之前說的，要幫我們找人嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100207,
					"content": "#是的，「公子」大人答應會為{F#妳}{M#你}們找到能夠突破僵局的人。「愚人眾」執行官的承諾從不落空。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉卡捷琳娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100208,
					"content": "那麼，他人在哪？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100209,
					"content": "大人在<color=#00E1FFFF>「琉璃亭」</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "葉卡捷琳娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100210,
					"content": "琉璃亭？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100211
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100211,
					"content": "呀，是琉璃亭！我聽說過！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100212,
					"content": "璃月的兩大菜系，「璃菜」和「月菜」，互相鬥爭了幾百年，不分上下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100213,
					"content": "「璃菜」的最高代表，就是「琉璃亭」酒家。老闆特地把店開在了緋雲坡，和代表「月菜」的「新月軒」當面競爭呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100214,
						10100215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100214,
					"content": "派蒙只有在這種時候才像個好嚮導。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100216
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100216,
					"content": "#不要這麼說嘛——總之，有好吃的！{NICKNAME}，我們快點過去吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100215,
					"content": "一到蹭吃蹭喝的話題，妳就…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100216
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100203,
					"content": "我不打算加入「愚人眾」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100204
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 101003,
			"completionStepIds": [
				101003
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"101003",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 101003,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"「公子」"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 10100301,
					"content": "#喲，{F#妳}{M#你}們來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100302,
					"content": "#約定已經完成了，我找到了能幫助{F#妳}{M#你}們的人——能解決「岩神的仙體被七星藏匿」這個難題的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100303,
					"content": "那麼，這個人又在哪？<color=#00E1FFFF>「琉璃亭」</color>裡嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100304,
					"content": "沒錯。跟我來吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100305,
					"content": "我準備了一場——嗯，在這個國家，叫做「飯局」的見面儀式。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 101005,
			"completionStepIds": [
				101005
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"101005",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 101005,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"鍾離"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 10100501,
					"content": "我來介紹一下，這位朋友是道上人士、「往生堂」的客卿，鍾離先生。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100502,
						10100503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100502,
					"content": "道上人士？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100504,
					"content": "嗯，在璃月，像「往生堂」這樣的產業，總是不得不接觸一些「道上」的生意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100505,
					"content": "而我們愚人眾，一向都喜歡與這些…在陰影中行走的朋友們打交道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100506,
					"content": "在，在陰影中行走…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100507,
					"content": "#二位，幸會。我聽過{F#妳}{M#你}們在蒙德的傳聞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100508,
					"content": "道上人士…陰影…送人「往生」…哇！難道說，「往生堂」這個組織，是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100509,
					"content": "沒錯，正如妳所猜測。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100510,
					"content": "呀——！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100511,
					"content": "「往生堂」是執掌葬儀的組織，旨在送人安心往生。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100512,
					"content": "咦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100513,
					"content": "哈哈，難道是把鍾離先生誤認成殺手了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100514,
					"content": "愚人眾的朋友裡確實有很多殺手，但「往生堂」並不是做這一行的…起碼明面上不是。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100515,
					"content": "明面上…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100516
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100516,
					"content": "#畢竟還是「道上人士」嘛，這就不能細說了。總之，我帶{F#妳}{M#你}們來認識鍾離，是因為…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100517,
					"content": "#因為我有辦法讓{F#妳}{M#你}們見到岩王帝君的仙體。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100518,
					"content": "什麼？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100519,
					"content": "哈，不必驚訝，雖然在「天權星」凝光的操縱下，岩神的仙體早已被藏匿起來…但，還是先聽聽鍾離的說法吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100520,
					"content": "岩王帝君雖是眾仙之祖，但說到底也算是仙人之一。縱觀璃月數千年的歷史，仙人紛紛離去，這是不可挽回的趨勢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100521,
					"content": "#因為時代變了——{F#妳}{M#你}在絕雲間，應該也已體會到這種變遷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100522,
						10100523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100522,
					"content": "確實，仙人們正在遠離璃月。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100525
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100525,
					"content": "#如{F#妳}{M#你}所見，仙眾的時代正在遠去，人的時代正在逐漸成為現實。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100526,
					"content": "往年每位仙人離去時，都會有一場盛大的紀念儀式。這是璃月的傳統。但這次竟連七星都無暇顧及這項傳統…實在不成樣子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100527,
					"content": "畢竟是「謀殺神明的奇案」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100528
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100528,
					"content": "是啊，連真正的兇手都沒抓到呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100529,
					"content": "謀殺神明的奇案…「往生堂」不關心這種事。「往生堂」關心的是，請仙的儀式如此隆重，送仙的儀式就沒人管了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100530,
					"content": "#旅者，我從「公子」那裡聽說了{F#妳}{M#你}的事。既然{F#妳}{M#你}與風神有些交情…那麼，可否考慮與我一起，籌備一場送別岩神的儀式？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100531,
						10100534,
						10100536
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100531,
					"content": "我需要再思考一下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100532
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100532,
					"content": "#唔…{NICKNAME}，仔細想想，恐怕也沒有別的辦法了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100533
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100533,
					"content": "沒錯，再多思考也是一樣的結果。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100539
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100539,
					"content": "#「天權」凝光…她正在阻止任何人瞻仰帝君的仙體。所以，如果{F#妳}{M#你}想達成尋訪七神的目標，就只剩這樣一條管道了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100540
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100540,
					"content": "#正是如此。唯有參與「送仙典儀」，{F#妳}{M#你}才能再次得見岩神之軀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100541
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100541,
					"content": "看來也沒有別的辦法了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100542
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100542,
					"content": "#嗯，若{F#妳}{M#你}答允，就跟我來吧。詳細的情況，我們路上再說。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100543
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100543,
					"content": "（黑畫面，鍾離出門）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100544
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100544,
					"content": "好了，我牽線搭橋的任務已經完成了。怎樣，這結果還不錯吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100545
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100545,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們要走的話就走吧，不用管我，我也許會在這裡再喝幾杯…順便熟悉一下「筷子」的用法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100534,
					"content": "要接受邀請，也不是不行…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100535
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100535,
					"content": "明智之選。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100539
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100536,
					"content": "「公子」的話太多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100537
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100537,
					"content": "哦？在「道上」，這句話就是要滅口的意思了…很有意思，拔劍吧，我們就在這裡——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100538
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100538,
					"content": "開玩笑的。我們繼續說正事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100539
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「公子」"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100523,
					"content": "七神之一的岩神，也是仙人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100524
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100524,
					"content": "神有許多尊名。契約之神、商業之神、武神、摩拉克斯、岩王帝君…其中自然也包括「仙人」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100503,
					"content": "往生堂？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100504
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 101006,
			"completionStepIds": [
				101006
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"101006",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 101006,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"鍾離"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 10100601,
					"content": "#旅者，經歷了「神離開的城邦」以後，{F#妳}{M#你}對璃月這「有神之地」，感受如何呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100602,
						10100605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100602,
					"content": "我更喜歡蒙德的氣氛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100603
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100603,
					"content": "#原來如此…{F#妳}{M#你}是這種類型的遊人。那也不錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100604,
					"content": "#不過，「有神之地」三千七百年的歷史厚度，或許{F#妳}{M#你}還沒有完全體驗到吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100607,
					"content": "#籌辦「送仙典儀」的過程，也會成為{F#妳}{M#你}旅途的一部分，增廣見聞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100608,
					"content": "璃月是塵世七國裡最繁榮的一國，往年也有神靈鎮守、七星統治。所以「愚人眾」的許多外交手段，在璃月都施展不開。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100609,
					"content": "七星之一的凝光，始終對愚人眾重重防備，或許這就是「公子」想借「往生堂」關係辦事的原因吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100610,
					"content": "唔…我們要辦「送仙典儀」，對「公子」有什麼好處呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100611,
					"content": "我不知道，也不想知道。對我來說，「愚人眾」只是提供資金援助，我只希望璃月的傳統不要被人遺忘。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100612,
					"content": "（鍾離交給主角一個錢袋）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100613,
					"content": "這是「公子」給的第一筆墊付資金。如果用完，也可以再去找他報帳後續款項。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100614,
					"content": "哇哦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100615,
					"content": "好了，我們動身吧。籌備儀式的第一步…是要取得品質足以匹配神靈的，最上等的<color=#00E1FFFF>「夜泊石」</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10100605,
					"content": "果然還是璃月好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100606
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10100606,
					"content": "嗯，「有神之地」三千七百年的歷史厚度，在七國中亦是最深。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10100607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				}
			]
		},
